</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When each can feel his brother’s sigh,</l><l>And with him bear a part;</l><l>When sorrow flows from eye to eye,</l><l>And joy from heart to heart;</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>When, free from envy, scorn and pride,</l><l>Our wishes all above,</l><l>Each can his brother’s failings hide,</l><l>And show a brother’s love;</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>When love, in one delightful stream,</l><l>Through every bosom flows;</l><l>When union sweet, and dear esteem,</l><l>In every action glows.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Love is the golden chain that binds;</l><l>The saints Thy grace thus prove.</l><l>And he is glory’s heir that finds</l><l>His bosom glow with love.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
